  "id": "USN-8357-1",
  "summary": "qtdeclarative-opensource-src vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that Qt Declarative did not properly validate the\nwidth and height attributes of image tags in the Text component of Qt\nQuick. An attacker could possibly use this issue to cause Qt Declarative\nto use excessive resources, leading to a denial of service.",
